  <h2>1. What We Collect</h2>
  <p>
    We collect minimal data:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Email address</strong> — only if you subscribe to our newsletter (optional).</li>
    <li><strong>Anonymous analytics</strong> — page views via Cloudflare Web Analytics (no cookies, no tracking).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Affiliate Tracking</h2>
  <p>
    When you click an affiliate link, the retailer (e.g., Amazon) may place a cookie
