    You can clear cookies in your browser settings at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Third Parties</h2>
  <p>
    We use:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Amazon Associates</strong> — for affiliate links.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — for hosting and anonymous analytics.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
  <p>
    You have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal data we hold.
    Contact us at hello@ТВІЙ-ДОМЕН.com. Since we collect almost nothing,
    this should be straightforward.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions? Email hello@ТВІЙ-ДОМЕН.com.
  </p>
</article>

</BaseLayout>
